                                        "entry_id": "70e6eedf-436d-382b-9556-cc3c1fa5e9db",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Having the same genetic structure; exhibiting homogeny."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ac048b85-9b34-4c60-af12-7c0f17d5e0bb",
                                                "sense_id": "6a371c27-4d7b-3bb4-907a-630313b23358",
                                                "text": "It is quite possible to have, on the one hand, developmental homogeny between parts which are not ancestrally homogenous, and, on the other, to have ancestral homogeny between parts which are not developmentally homogenous."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
